# Party chat save test, part 1 (docs/re-party-chat.md); run with --save on a party-chat build.
# Fountain Square with flag 0xB poked on has two entries: the example chat, then the vanilla hint.
# Read only the example chat (one Y), then save to album No.1 with Select. Part 2 reloads that save.
include boot_from_save
wait 60
poke u32 0x02204620 0x802
pin u16 0x020B77EC 164
press Right 40
press Down,Right 40
press Right 40
press Down 80
wait 200
unpin
wait 60
peek u16 0x020B6BE4 map
press Y 3
wait 120
shot sa_chat
press A 3
wait 90
press A 3
wait 90
press A 3
wait 60
press A 3
wait 60
peek u16 0x020B8056 figures_flags_before_save
shot sa_icon_0
wait 4
shot sa_icon_4
dump 0x02204620 0x5C flags_saved
press Select 3
wait 100
press A 3
wait 40
shot sa_save_1
press A 3
wait 60
shot sa_save_2
press A 3
wait 120
shot sa_save_3
press A 3
wait 60
shot sa_save_4
wait 120
shot sa_field
